#. Machine-translated technical prose; navigation reviewed and references preserved.
#: ../../source/troubleshooting/ascend_910b_operators.rst:26
msgid ""
"The recorded Xinference-launched process did not inherit the custom operator paths "
"that were present in the working native vLLM environment."
msgstr "기록에서 Xinference로 실행된 프로세스는 정상 작동하던 네이티브 vLLM 환경에 있던 사용자 지정 연산자 경로를 상속하지 않았습니다."

#. Machine-translated technical prose; navigation reviewed and references preserved.
#: ../../source/troubleshooting/ascend_910b_operators.rst
msgid "Diagnosis"
msgstr "진단"

#. Machine-translated technical prose; navigation reviewed and references preserved.
#: ../../source/troubleshooting/ascend_910b_operators.rst:27
msgid ""
"The missing custom GDN/Mamba operator environment caused a fallback to the built-in "
"CANN operator, which rejected the model's float32 state in this case."
msgstr "이 사례에서는 사용자 지정 GDN/Mamba 연산자 환경이 없어 내장 CANN 연산자로 폴백되었고, 이 연산자가 모델의 float32 상태를 거부했습니다."

#. Machine-translated technical prose; navigation reviewed and references preserved.
#: ../../source/troubleshooting/ascend_910b_operators.rst:29
msgid ""
"Check both ``ASCEND_CUSTOM_OPP_PATH`` and the custom ``op_api/lib`` entry in "
"``LD_LIBRARY_PATH`` before changing model precision."
msgstr ""
"모델 정밀도를 변경하기 전에  ``ASCEND_CUSTOM_OPP_PATH``  및  ``LD_LIBRARY_PATH``  의 사용자 지정  "
"``op_api/lib``  항목을 모두 확인하십시오."

#. Machine-translated technical prose; navigation reviewed and references preserved.
#: ../../source/troubleshooting/ascend_910b_operators.rst:32
msgid "Load the operator environment"
msgstr "연산자 환경 로드"

#. Machine-translated technical prose; navigation reviewed and references preserved.
#: ../../source/troubleshooting/ascend_910b_operators.rst:34
msgid ""
"Source the vLLM-Ascend custom environment in the same shell that starts Xinference. "
"Adjust the installation path for your image."
msgstr "Xinference를 시작하는 동일한 셸에서 vLLM-Ascend 사용자 지정 환경을 source합니다. 설치 경로는 이미지에 맞게 조정하십시오."

#. Machine-translated technical prose; navigation reviewed and references preserved.
#: ../../source/troubleshooting/ascend_910b_operators.rst:42
msgid ""
"Align model parameters with the working native launch. These are the values from the "
"original test, not defaults for every deployment."
msgstr "모델 파라미터를 정상 작동하는 네이티브 실행과 일치시킵니다. 이 값은 원래 테스트의 값이며 모든 배포의 기본값이 아닙니다."

#. Machine-translated technical prose; navigation reviewed and references preserved.
