#. Machine-translated technical prose; navigation reviewed and references preserved.
#: ../../source/troubleshooting/ascend_910b_operators.rst:57
msgid "Verification"
msgstr "검증"

#. Machine-translated technical prose; navigation reviewed and references preserved.
#: ../../source/troubleshooting/ascend_910b_operators.rst:59
msgid ""
"Launch through Xinference again, inspect the inherited operator environment and "
"confirm that the dtype error is gone and chat output is coherent. Record CANN, torch-"
"npu, vLLM and vLLM-Ascend versions alongside the image tag."
msgstr ""
"Xinference를 통해 다시 실행하고 상속된 연산자 환경을 확인하여 dtype 오류가 사라지고 채팅 출력이 일관적인지 확인합니다. 이미지 태그와 함께"
" CANN, torch-npu, vLLM 및 vLLM-Ascend 버전을 기록하십시오."

